        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Belts of stiffened ribbed silk embroidered with coloured silks. White and marked at intervals with irregular patches in purple. Delicate floral scrolls and two kinds of badges - a circle enclosing three radiating slender leaves, of oval form, between two indented lozenge-shaped figures, each containing a couple of small billets. There is a wide border of lozenge diaper."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/e75d30a7-08e5-3f27-b419-9ab324da3d87> .

